    {
      "source": "Visits an array value of the annotation. Note that arrays of primitive values (such as byte,\nboolean, short, char, int, long, float or double) can be passed as value to <a href=\"../../asm/AnnotationVisitor.html#visit(java.lang.String,java.lang.Object)\"><code>visit</code></a>. This is what <a href=\"../../asm/ClassReader.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.asm\"><code>ClassReader</code></a> does for non empty arrays of primitive values.",
      "translation": "访问注解的数组值。注意，基本类型（如 byte、boolean、short、char、int、long、float 或 double）的数组可以作为 `<a href=\"../../asm/AnnotationVisitor.html#visit(java.lang.String,java.lang.Object)\"><code>visit</code></a>` 的值传递。<a href=\"../../asm/ClassReader.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.asm\"><code>ClassReader</code></a> 正是对非空的基本类型数组执行此操作。",
      "count": 2
    },
